  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Flow Mapping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ambition of Netherlands embassy in Accra, Ghana, is to contribute to transforming the horticultural sector in Ghana into a vibrant, sustainable and competitive sector that offers employment opportunities for youth.Given the new combi-track focus on sustainable trade investments, the Netherlands embassy would like to enhance understanding of various facets within the horticultural value chain.This market flow mapping exercise will assess the current state of the market and identify business cases for Dutch investors.The geographical scope of the study will encompass the whole of Ghana to identify or validate the &apos;centre points&apos; of horticultural trade in the country, but focusses on the regions the Netherlands is most active in: Ahafo, Ashanti, Bono, Bono East, Greater Accra and Volta</narrative>
  </description>
